  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistive Technology for school-aged children in the Indo-Pacific and beyond - 2024-29</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports an increased access to Assistive Technology (AT) and rehabilitation services for school-aged children in selected countries in the Indo-Pacific. 
It includes the &apos;Accelerating Inclusion&apos; pilot program in partnership with ATscale, the Global Partnership for Assistive Technology, hosted by the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS).</narrative>
  </description>
